_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksCondition}_S(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksCondition}_S(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sacks forcing consists of perfect subtrees of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>, ordered by inclusion in the associated forcing-poset definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksCondition}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SacksCondition}_S(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T).","display":true},{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":838,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3334","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-sacks-condition.md|58-df-zfc-sacks-condition]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","aba489b7551a80b3"]}